OL,3,GNEWSAPolice interview fatal bin lorry
OL,4,Acrash driver
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice investigating a fatal crash in
OL,7,Fwhich a bin lorry hit a building have
OL,8,Finterviewed a 51-year-old man.
OL,10,FThe man, who was the vehicle's driver,
OL,11,Fspoke to officers voluntarily in
OL,12,Fconnection with the collision in
OL,13,FLeominster last November in which
OL,14,FAndzie "Stan" Stanik, 62, died and two
OL,15,Fothers were seriously injured.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
