OL,3,GNEWSAPolice interview fatal bin lorry
OL,4,Acrash driver
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe crash happened at the junction of
OL,7,FMill, Bridge and Broad streets, with
OL,8,Fthe injured pair airlifted to hospital
OL,9,Fin Birmingham after crews had
OL,10,Fdifficulties rescuing them because the
OL,11,Fcrash had left the empty building
OL,12,Funstable.
OL,14,FHerefordshire Council previously said
OL,15,Fthe man who died in the crash, which
OL,16,Fcontinues to be investigated by police,
OL,17,Fworked for its contractor FCC
OL,18,FEnvironment.
